<title>HONG KONG: LG Chemical sets US$66 mln loan.</title>
<headline>LG Chemical sets US$66 mln loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following syndicated loan issue was announced by arranger DKB Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LG CHEMICAL LTD</p>
<p> AMOUNT     US$66 MLN  TYPE	TERM LOAN</p>
<p> MARGIN     L+45BP     MATURITY  5 YRS     AVGE LIFE  --</p>
<p> PUTS	 NONE	 CALLS     NONE	LAUNCHED   11.NOV.96</p>
<p> DRAWDOWN   MULTIPLE   AVAIL     12 MTHS   HOME CTRY  S. KOREA</p>
<p> REPAYMENT  BULLET     REPLIES   22.NOV.96 GOV LAW    --</p>
<p> NOTES	PROCEEDS WILL BE USED TO PROVIDE FUNDINGS FOR THE</p>
<p>		BORROWER'S OVERSEAS INVESTMENT.</p>
<p>ARRANGERS  CREDIT LYONNAIS, DKB ASIA, IBJ ASIA AND KOREA</p>
<p>		DEVELOPMENT BANK</p>
<p> CO-ARRANGERS   MITSUBISHI TRUST AND SUMITOMO TRUST</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES</p>
<p>   LEAD MANAGERS     US$5 MLN+   30BP  ALL-IN  51</p>
<p>   MANAGERS	    US$3-4 MLN  25BP  ALL-IN  50</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852)2843 6960</p>
</text>
